{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40790","headline":"伤张玖秀才 · 唐求","name":"伤张玖秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜梁剑阁几区区，十上探珠不见珠。\n卞玉影沈沙草闇，骅骝声断陇城孤。\n入关词客秋怀友，出户孀妻晓望夫。\n吴水楚山千万里，旅魂归到故乡无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}